<title>BELGIUM: Spaniard appointed VP of Plant Variety Office.</title>
<headline>Spaniard appointed VP of Plant Variety Office.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farm ministers agreed to the appointment of Spaniard Jose Elena Rossello as vice president of the new European Union Plant Variety Office, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>It also appointed German Gabrielle Winkler as president of the chamber of the board of appeal of the office, which will be located in Angers, France.</p>
</text>
